title: 'statement-store: rename the v2 DHT path to the DHT path'
doc:
- audience: [Node Operator, Node Dev]
  description: |-
    A rename with no change of behaviour. The flag `--statement-v2-dht` becomes
    `--statement-dht`, and the metrics `substrate_sync_statement_v2dht_*` become
    `substrate_sync_statement_dht_*`. In the code `v2dht_enabled`, `set_v2dht_enabled` and
    `V2DhtConfig` become `dht_enabled`, `set_dht_enabled` and `DhtConfig`, and the `v2dht` field
    of the statement store configuration becomes `dht`.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: major
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
- name: staging-node-cli
  bump: major
